--- !u!114 &1509045354
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1509045352}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a8a6828637c11124c9c0472321e9dcb3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueScript
  dialogueText: {fileID: 837247994}
  lines:
  - "Detective: Hello Rose, I\u2019m detective Hughes and I\u2019m here to interrogate
    you if that\u2019s ok with you."
  - "Rose: Ummm\u2026 Sure I guess."
  - 'Detective: You went shopping at the same time as Chloe yesterday. Did something
    happen?'
  - 'Rose: She saw me and started laughing. Same as always.'
  - 'Detective: That led to an argument?'
  - "Rose: Yes. I told her to stop. She called me pathetic. I told her she\u2019d
    regret it one day, and now\u2026 she\u2019s dead."
  - "Detective: That\u2019s a very odd thing to say given the situation."
  - "Rose: I didn\u2019t kill her."
  - 'Detective: After the argument, what did you do?'
  - "Rose: I left the store because I was shaking. I didn\u2019t want to be near
    her anymore. I needed air."
  - 'Detective: And?'
  - "Rose: I came back into the store. My shopping bag was still inside. I\u2019d
    left it in one of the aisles when we argued. I went back to get it while she
    was inside the fitting room."
  - 'Detective: So you went back in right as she was being killed. That puts you
    in a very tight window of time.'
  - "Rose: I didn\u2019t do anything."
  - "Detective: We\u2019ll see. Hand over your phone. It should help confirm your
    statement."
  - 'Rose: ...Fine'
  - "*Rose\u2019s profile has been added to your suspects folder*."
  textSpeed: 0.05
